# The Real Gift (otherAreas 22): Selbina's Oswald (no script; default 30). Only the available section reads
# xi.settings.map.FISHING_ENABLE (false by default), so this flow starts from the quest accepted by a GM (the offer is
# `#offer`). Under the Sea and The Sand Charm completed; The Gift available (its section reads the setting: off). A level
# 30 Warrior with three Shall Shells (they stack) and a Chocobo Feather. Accepted: Oswald 74 (4484); trades: two shells:
# nil; a shell and the feather: nil; the feather: nil; a shell: 75, finished: completed (the Glass Fiber Fishing Rod,
# The Love Doctor), fame +10 San d'Oria and Bastok, the shell taken. Completed: Oswald 76 (a progressEvent with
# replaceDefault, over his 30). A shell traded while completed: no section 2, nothing.
lists Selbina/Oswald/onTrigger Selbina/Oswald/onTrade Selbina/onEventFinish/75
char zone=Selbina pos=48.6,-15.3,8 job=WAR lvl=30
quest OtherAreas.UnderTheSea completed
quest OtherAreas.TheSandCharm completed
quest OtherAreas.TheRealGift accepted
item ShallShell x3
item ChocoboFeather
login
trigger Oswald                          # accepted: 74 (4484)
finish
trade Oswald ShallShell x2              # two: nil
trade Oswald ShallShell x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # an extra item: nil
trade Oswald ChocoboFeather x1          # no shell: nil
trade Oswald ShallShell x1              # 75
finish                                  # completed: the rod, the title; fame +10 San d'Oria and Bastok; the shell taken
trigger Oswald                          # completed: 76 (replaceDefault)
finish
trade Oswald ShallShell x1              # completed: no section 2; nothing
